  "description": "Authentication for the Klassd.Workflows dashboard: a Users admin (email + password local accounts) plus cookie sign-in. A thin profile over the Klassd.Auth packages — SSO is added separately via Klassd.Workflows.Auth.OpenIdConnect, which links to an existing user by email. Authentication is bypassed for loopback requests, so local development and `kubectl port-forward` need no login. AddKlassdWorkflowsAuth() + UseKlassdWorkflowsAuth().",
